  ('merida-mexico', '10S', 'Mérida, Yucatán', 'Mexico', 'Mérida Yucatán travel guide', 'live', 'verified', 'kyoto', 'Yucatán (Mérida & Chichén Itzá)', '{"romance","expedition","culture","culinary"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, null, '{"key_facts":["Capital of Yucatán state and the peninsula''s cultural + medical hub; nicknamed ''La Ciudad Blanca'' (the White City).","The FCDO names no advisory against travel to Yucatán.","Heart of the restored-hacienda hotel circuit — Chablé, four Luxury Collection haciendas, Angsana Xcanatún — the region''s signature luxury supply.","Distinct Yucatecan cuisine (cochinita pibil, sopa de lima, mucbipollo) centered on the 1887 Mercado Lucas de Gálvez (~2,000 stalls).","Gateway to cenote country, Celestún/Río Lagartos flamingos, Uxmal + Ruta Puuc, and Chichén Itzá; Gulf beach at Progreso ~35 min north."],"safety":{"emergency":"911","hospital":"Star Médica Mérida; Christus Muguerza Faro del Mayab; Centro Médico de las Américas (CMA); Clínica de Mérida — regional trauma/medical hub","book_enabled":true,"air_access_verified":"MID — Mérida Manuel Crescencio Rejón International (direct US: DFW, IAH, MIA)","heat":"Hot-humid May–Sep; Apr–Jun can exceed 100°F (38°C) — extreme-heat protocol on daytime ruin/cenote outings","water":"Bottled only (do not drink tap; use bottled for tooth-brushing)","malaria":"No malaria risk in Mérida / Yucatán tourist corridor; dengue present, chikungunya rising (2025–26) — mosquito precautions","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","read":"2026-08-20T14:49:02Z","page_updated":"2026-07-16T16:08:09+01:00","source_country":"mexico","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely","fcdo_zones":[{"name":"The city of Tijuana, in Baja California","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","except":["airside transit through Tijuana airport","