-a-complete-guide-for-nature-lovers/","si":"wildlife","commission":"guide/DMC; entry non-commissionable","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","romance":"destination","wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Curi-Cancha Reserve","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"essential","source":"https://mytanfeet.com/activities/birdwatching-at-curi-cancha-reserve/","si":"wildlife","commission":"guide/DMC; entry non-commissionable","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","romance":"destination","wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Bat Jungle","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"essential","source":"https://monteverdecostarica-info.weebly.com/monteverde-bat-jungle.html","si":"wildlife","commission":"affiliate/pass-through","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","romance":"destination","wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":["affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Butterfly Garden + glass-frog vivarium","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"essential","source":"https://tours.co.cr/activities-in-monteverde/","si":"wildlife","commission":"affiliate/pass-through","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","romance":"destination","wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":["affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Monteverde Cheese Factory (La Lecheria) + coffee","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.costarica-spirit.com/destinations/monteverde/","si":"wildlife","commission":"DMC/guide add-on","wells":["eat"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","romance":"destination","wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Hidden Canopy Treehouses (adults-only)","si_tag":"romance","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.enchantingtravels.com/hotels/monteverde/hidden-canopy-treehouse/","si":"romance","commission":"consortia/DMC","wells":["activities","stay"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["romance"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","romance":"primary","wildlife":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC","consortia"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"Which is the best zipline in Monteverde?","a":"It depends on your appetite. Selvatura''s flagship runs 13 ziplines including a 1 km line, 15 platforms, a Tarzan swing and 8 hanging bridges; 100% Aventura is the adrenaline pick with 11 ziplines including two Superman lines; Sky Adventures is the family-friendly tram-up, zip-down option.","source":"selvatura.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"When is quetzal season in Monteverde?","a":"Peak sightings run February–June (breeding), with March–April the sweet spot. Best hours are 6–9 AM, when males feed on wild avocado; a guided dawn quetzal walk (~$40–80, 2–3 hrs) is among Costa Rica''s best-value wildlife experiences.","source":"monteverdetravel.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"wildlife-&-nature-—-future"},{"q":"Is Monteverde good for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes — it''s a genuine eco-romance hub, not a beach substitute. Adults-only Hidden Canopy Treehouses are the honeymoon centerpiece, and Hotel Belmar offers Forest Superior rooms with a jacuzzi and private terrace for a mist-and-forest soak; both run boutique-luxe, not palace-scale.","source":"enchantingtravels.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"Is ziplining in Monteverde dangerous?","a":"It''s high-consequence if gear or technique fails, so ride only with certified operators. Confirm harness and dual-brake systems, helmet and stated weight limits before booking with Selvatura, Sky Adventures or 100% Aventura — high-speed lines and Superman/Tarzan configurations raise the stakes.","source":"selvatura.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"How hard is the drive to Monteverde?","a":"It''s a real mountain climb. Monteverde sits at ~1,400 m, roughly 3–4 hours from Juan Santamaría (SJO), with the final stretch a rough, partly-unpaved and fog-prone road — drive in daylight, 4WD recommended, allow extra time.","source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/costa-rica","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Monteverde Cloud Forest, Costa Rica: Quetzals, Ziplines & Cloud-Forest Lodges | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan Monteverde - the original cloud-forest zipline, resplendent-quetzal birding, hanging bridges, night walks, and boutique eco-lodges. Best times, safety, and how to book.","search_language":"es-CR","local_keywords":["bosque nuboso Monteverde","canopy Monteverde","reserva Santa Elena","quetzal Monteverde temporada","puentes colgantes Monteverde","tour nocturno Monteverde","hoteles ecologicos Monteverde","como llegar a Monteverde"],"hreflang":["en","es-CR"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-06","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-06","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/costa-rica","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:18Z","source_updated":"2026-05-19T11:42:25+01:00"}]},"long_tail":["Monteverde cloud forest guide 2026","best zipline in Monteverde","resplendent quetzal season Monteverde","Monteverde vs Santa Elena reserve","Monteverde hanging bridges","Monteverde night walk","luxury eco lodge Monteverde","how to get to Monteverde from San Jose","Monteverde honeymoon treehouse"]},"booking":{"advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":["expedition","wildlife","romance"],"ultra":[{"name":"Hotel Belmar","type":"premier boutique eco-lodge","note":"CST level 5, first carbon-neutral in Monteverde, brewery, Nicoya Suites ~1000sqft, ~$270-1200/nt; Design Hotels + Mr&Mrs Smith listed; no confirmed Virtuoso","consortia":"Design Hotels / Mr & Mrs Smith / Fora","mor":"consortia commission or DMC block","tier":"premium-boutique (NOT ultra-palace)"},{"name":"Hidden Canopy Treehouses","type":"adults-only luxury treehouses","note":"R&H apex, secluded canopy","consortia":"consortia/DMC","mor":"consortia/DMC","tier":"premium-boutique"},{"name":"Senda Monteverde","type":"modern sustainable boutique","note":"private trails, farm-to-table","consortia":"consortia/DMC","mor":"consortia/DMC","tier":"premium-boutique"},{"name":"Koora Monteverde","type":"newest boutique eco-lodge","note":"26 rooms (10 suites/6 bungalows/10 forest)","consortia":"consortia/DMC","mor":"consortia/DMC","tier":"premium-boutique"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-06","hero":{"query":"Monteverde, Costa Rica"},"geo":{"lat":10.301,"lng":-84.8259},"orbit":[{"id":"guanacaste-costa-rica","jewels":10,"si":["tropical","expedition","liveaboard","wellness","wildlife"]},{"id":"la-fortuna-arenal-costa-rica","jewels":10,"si":["expedition","romance","wellness"]},{"id":"manuel-antonio-costa-rica","jewels":9,"si":["tropical","expedition","wildlife"]},{"id":"nosara-costa-rica","jewels":10,"si":["tropical","expedition","wellness"]},{"id":"osa-peninsula-corcovado-costa-rica","jewels":9,"si":["expedition","diveglobal"]},{"id":"puerto-viejo-costa-rica","jewels":10,"si":["tropical","expedition","culture","wildlife","ocean"]},{"id":"san-jose-costa-rica","jewels":13,"si":["culture","expedition"]},{"id":"tortuguero-costa-rica","jewels":6,"si":["expedition","river"]}],"orbit_country":[]}'::jsonb, 70)
